      "severity": "P1",
      "section": "R18, AE17",
      "why_it_matters": "Supporting both sinks on both backends requires validating local dry-run, local test-inbox, Asynq dry-run, and Asynq test-inbox as distinct operational paths. AE17 additionally requires the test-inbox behavior to work with either backend. This turns two narrow demonstrations into a combinatorial compatibility obligation and makes the networked Asynq path part of the credible scope.",
