      "autofix_class": "manual",
      "suggested_fix": "Replace the first sentence of R18 with: \"The required combination is `--sink=dry-run --backend=local`. The optional test-inbox demonstration, if implemented, supports only `--sink=test-inbox --backend=local`; the optional Asynq demonstration, if implemented, supports only `--sink=dry-run --backend=asynq`. The test-inbox and Asynq options are not required to compose.\" Replace AE17's phrase \"when either backend uses the test-inbox sink\" with \"when the local backend uses the test-inbox sink\". Remove \"all four combinations are supported\" and the requirement that every combination preserve all semantics.",
