      "autofix_class": "manual",
      "suggested_fix": "Narrow R16 to the local backend and state: \"The optional test-inbox demonstration is single-process and does not need to prove delivery behavior across worker crashes or distributed redelivery.\" Narrow AE18 to Asynq with the dry-run sink: \"For the Asynq dry-run demonstration, retries and duplicate attempts must not double-count campaign completion; no network delivery effect is required.\" Remove the AE17 requirement that test-inbox effects remain at-most-once under duplicate task execution.",
