      "severity": "P1",
      "section": "R17, AE19, AE20",
      "why_it_matters": "Waiting for distributed terminal completion while remaining honest through enqueue failure, Redis interruption during reconciliation, worker shutdown, cancellation, delayed retries, and redelivery requires durable campaign lifecycle state, terminal closure, recovery/reconciliation logic, and coordination between workers and the CLI. That is materially broader than a bounded Asynq execution demonstration and conflicts with the stated exclusion of a campaign-status or distributed campaign platform.",
